  "09c80d20-d3cb-4522-b81a-4f2d9190a501"],
 "[",
 StyleBox["fib", "TI"],
 "]. Drawing coordinates belong to this result; the fibered graph itself \
remains unchanged."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ab432725-9fae-4225-afbc-52599044ff06"],

